@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Case Study
	Frontend testing for creating a www case study

Setup:
    * I get all test passwords and admin emails

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I sign out and sign into www as a user with the email address "${staticWWWAdminEmailAddress}" and password "${staticWWWAdminPassword}"
	* I tear down the following web content entries
	| ABC Education Test 1 |

Scenario: Add Case Study
	Admins should be able to add a case study on www.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the Sign In Create Account footer link
	And I sign into www as a user with the email address "${staticWWWAdminEmailAddress}" and password "${staticWWWAdminPassword}"
	And I navigate to the Product Menu and go to the "Web Content" portlet under the "Content & Data" category under the "Site Administration" panel
	And I go to the web content folder "RESOURCES"
	And I go to the web content folder "CASE STUDIES"
	And I go to a new form for a "Case Study" web content
	And I expand the "Categorization" header in the side panel
	And I populate the following web content fields and values
	| Title                |                 | ABC Education Test 1                                                 |
	| Company Name         | Input           | ABC Education 1                                                      |
	| Company Logo         | File Upload     | RESOURCE LIBRARY,case-studies,ABC EDUCATION,ABC Education logo yello |
	| Subheading           | Input           | Heading 1                                                            |
	| Summary              | Textarea        | This is the first test summary                                       |
	| Subheading           | Input           | Heading 2                                                            |
	| Summary              | Textarea        | This is the second test summary                                      |
	| Quote                | Textarea        | I am the first to comment on this case study                         |
	| Quotee               | Input           | First User                                                           |
	| Quotee Info          | Input           | The first user to comment                                            |
	| Asset                | File Upload     | RESOURCE LIBRARY,case-studies,ABC EDUCATION,ABC Education            |
	| Button Text          | Input           | ABC Education Case Study PDF                                         |
	| Additional Image     | File Upload     | RESOURCE LIBRARY,case-studies,ABC EDUCATION,ABC Education screenshot |
	| Key Features         | Textarea        | We have features like you cannot imagine                             |
	| Challenges           | Input           | One big challenge                                                    |
	| Challenges           | Input           | Another slightly bigger challenge                                    |
	| Result               | Input           | Result 1                                                             |
	| Brief Description    | Input           | First result from dealing with challenge one                         |
	| Result               | Input           | Result 2                                                             |
	| Brief Description    | Input           | Second result from dealing with challenge two                        |
	| Category List Filter | Category Select | Resources                                                            |
	| Industries           | Category Select | Education                                                            |
	| Language             | Category Select | English                                                              |
	| Location             | Category Select | United States                                                        |
	| Resource Types       | Category Select | Case Studies                                                         |
	| Solutions            | Category Select | Customer Portals                                                     |
	| Topic                | Category Select | Digital Strategy                                                     |
	And I click the publish button
	And I sign out of www
	And I go to the www page with the url "resources"
	And I filter the resources in the Resource Library using the following filters and values
	| Resource Types | Case Studies |
	Then I should be able to view the resource with the title "ABC Education Test 1"
	When I go to the www page with the url "resource?title=abc-education-test-1"
	Then the following text should be visible on the page
	| Heading 1                                     |
	| This is the first test summary                |
	| Heading 2                                     |
	| This is the second test summary               |
	| ABC Education Case Study PDF                  |
	| I am the first to comment on this case study  |
	| First User                                    |
	| THE FIRST USER TO COMMENT                     |
	| Key Features                                  |
	| We have features like you cannot imagine      |
	| Challenges                                    |
	| One big challenge                             |
	| Another slightly bigger challenge             |
	| Results                                       |
	| Result 1                                      |
	| First result from dealing with challenge one  |
	| Result 2                                      |
	| Second result from dealing with challenge two |
#	| INDUSTRY                                      |
#	| Education                                     |
#	| LOCATION                                      |
#	| United States                                 |
#	| SOLUTION                                      |
#	| Customer Portals                              |
	| TOPIC                                         |
	| Digital Strategy                              |